OL,3,AG7 to release up to 100 million barrels
OL,4,Aof diesel and crude oil in bid to stop
OL,5,Asoaring prices
OL,6,
OL,7,FFollowing the G7 announcement, Trump
OL,8,Ftells reporters at the White House:
OL,9,F"We're not going to be doing the export
OL,10,Fban"
OL,12,FAverage UK diesel prices have hit a
OL,13,Frecord high, according to motoring
OL,14,Fgroup the RAC, reaching #2 a litre for
OL,15,Fthe first time
OL,17,FHowever, UK Transport Minister Keir
OL,18,FMather says Britain's supply of diesel
OL,19,Fis "robust" and "resilient" and the
OL,20,Fcountry has a wide range of sources
